-height:120%"&gt;Pre-2016 Merger entity that was converted to a limited liability company and changed its name to Cleco Corporate Holdings LLC on April 13, 2016&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Group LLC, a wholly owned subsidiary of Cleco Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Holdings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Corporate Holdings LLC, a wholly owned subsidiary of Cleco Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Partners L.P., a Delaware limited partnership that is owned by a consortium of investors, including funds